given event types. If no events of these types exist
in the text, output an empty list [].
\end{verbatim}
\end{small}
\vspace{-0.5em}
\begin{small}
\begin{verbatim}
Output as JSON: [{"text": "...", "type": "..."}]
\end{verbatim}
\end{small}

